1
00:00:12,349 --> 00:00:15,349
You march in here with that sickening glare!

2
00:00:15,390 --> 00:00:18,210
Think you're a man? Put your hands in the air!

3
00:00:18,219 --> 00:00:20,870
This is my house, you're a stain on the floor!

4
00:00:20,879 --> 00:00:24,320
I'm ripping your dreams right out of the door!

5
00:00:24,500 --> 00:00:27,570
I built this prison of concrete and hate!

6
00:00:27,750 --> 00:00:30,480
Bow to the master, accept your damn fate!

7
00:00:30,500 --> 00:00:33,079
You think you can speak? You think you can stand?!

8
00:00:33,250 --> 00:00:36,549
I'll crush your skull with the back of my hand!

9
00:00:36,719 --> 00:00:39,229
Your hands are shaking, you're gasping for breath!

10
00:00:39,270 --> 00:00:42,630
I'll push you down to the edges of death!

11
00:00:42,710 --> 00:00:45,380
You step up to me? You grab at the wood?!

12
00:00:45,409 --> 00:00:53,359
I'll make you bleed like a failure should!

13
00:01:12,500 --> 00:01:15,349
The table is broken, the china is dead!

14
00:01:15,359 --> 00:01:18,599
I'll beat the rebellion right out of your head!

15
00:01:18,629 --> 00:01:21,239
You crossed the line, now you're feeling the pain!

16
00:01:21,250 --> 00:01:24,709
I'll wash away all your filth down the drain!

17
00:01:24,719 --> 00:01:27,359
Blood on your face, you're a pathetic sight!

18
00:01:27,400 --> 00:01:30,590
Get back to your books, I am ending this fight!

19
00:01:30,599 --> 00:01:33,049
Forget about dancing, forget your romance!

20
00:01:33,060 --> 00:01:39,280
I'll beat you so hard that you won't ever dance!

21
00:01:48,500 --> 00:01:51,390
Crawl on the floor, you're a sickening joke!

22
00:01:51,430 --> 00:01:54,439
I'll tighten the grip until you start to choke!

23
00:01:54,459 --> 00:01:57,250
Get out of my sight, get up to your room!

24
00:01:57,269 --> 00:02:04,879
I am the architect of your damn doom!

25
00:02:05,209 --> 00:02:08,189
"Sickening joke!

26
00:02:08,280 --> 00:02:10,599
Start to choke!

27
00:02:10,689 --> 00:02:21,009
Your damn doom!"